{"id":"2741123380dc9932","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-thm-levy.md","title":"Lévy Collapse","display":"thm-levy — Lévy Collapse","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-levy","aliases":["58-thm-levy"],"display":"thm-levy — Lévy Collapse","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-levy.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-levy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-levy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-levy — Lévy Collapse"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a400266e1814b901\" href=\"?note=a400266e1814b901\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-levy.md\">../batch15/58-df-levy.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"06ee5d7ff126e916\" href=\"?note=06ee5d7ff126e916\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md\">../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\">\\(\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\\)</span> are cardinals, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> is regular, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> is inaccessible.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,{&lt;}\\lambda)\">\\(P=\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,{&lt;}\\lambda)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Card}^V\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Card}^V\\subseteq V\\)</span> is the class of ground-model cardinals.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S,\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S,\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}levy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S(\\lambda)\n\\land\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,{&lt;}\\lambda)\n\\Vdash\n\\left[\n\\check\\lambda=(\\check\\kappa)^+\n\\land\\forall\\mu\\in\\mathrm{Card}^V\\;\n\\bigl(\\kappa&lt;\\mu&lt;\\lambda\\to|\\check\\mu|=\\check\\kappa\\bigr)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}levy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S(\\lambda)\n\\land\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,{&lt;}\\lambda)\n\\Vdash\n\\left[\n\\check\\lambda=(\\check\\kappa)^+\n\\land\\forall\\mu\\in\\mathrm{Card}^V\\;\n\\bigl(\\kappa&lt;\\mu&lt;\\lambda\\to|\\check\\mu|=\\check\\kappa\\bigr)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The forcing collapses every ground-model cardinal strictly between <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> to size <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>, while preserving <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> and making <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> its successor.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-levy.md","status":"resolved","id":"a400266e1814b901","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-levy.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md","status":"resolved","id":"06ee5d7ff126e916","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa<\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"P=\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,{<}\\lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Card}^V\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S,\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}levy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S(\\lambda)\n\\land\\kappa<\\lambda\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,{<}\\lambda)\n\\Vdash\n\\left[\n\\check\\lambda=(\\check\\kappa)^+\n\\land\\forall\\mu\\in\\mathrm{Card}^V\\;\n\\bigl(\\kappa<\\mu<\\lambda\\to|\\check\\mu|=\\check\\kappa\\bigr)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false}],"bytes":1141,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4287","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-thm-levy.md|58-thm-levy]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["a400266e1814b901","0fbfc19800246e77","06ee5d7ff126e916"]}